---
name: BacklogGenerationAgentInstructions
description: Instructions for AI agent that transforms project descriptions into structured, market-aware backlogs with optional web search, validation loops, and delivery planning
authors:
  - Amaidi Chaima
model:
  api: chat
  configuration:
    type: azure_openai
